#problem(13)[
设全集 $U = \{a, b, c, d\}$，集合 $A = \{a, b\}$，$B = \{b, c, d\}$，则 $(\c o m p l e m e n t_U A) union (\c o m p l e m e n t_U B) =$#blank(){}.
]

